      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "proposal",
      "cat-harness:section": "Whose nodes — an instance publishes its own",
      "prov:value": "An `@id` the checkout-scope document mints and the instance-scope one does\nnot is held by its owner's own document, and this one says nothing about it:\nno forwarding node (clean break, owner 2026-11-02,\n[litlfred/cat-harness-tools#1378](https://github.com/litlfred/cat-harness-tools/issues/1378)).",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
