      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "Named subgraphs — one IRI, two files, framed from one graph",
      "prov:value": "**Contract (bean `c1m4`; owner rulings 2026-10-03).** A *named subgraph* is a\ndirectory of a declared graph, read as a set of KG nodes: `skills/` is one, and\nso is `sdlc/skills/`.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
