      "prov:value": "A *deep*\n  hydrated file at the root would be the whole graph in one document, which is\n  the monolith `f233` forbids. The owner ruled \"deep, but not at root\"; the\n  rejected options were shallow everywhere, deep everywhere, and size-capped."
    },
    {
