      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "Membership is declared, not inferred",
      "prov:value": "- **An overlaid instance heads its own tree** (bean `ax6r`). kg-export reads\n  the corpus of every instance stacked on this one, so the content core's\n  processes and skills are nodes of this graph.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "bean ax6r"
