    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/kg/kg-core/kg-export.md#provenance-60",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "What a slice file holds",
      "prov:value": "The client fetches\n  the payload when a result is opened. Measured on beans, the same 717 rows\n  take 7.85 MB with the bodies stored and 2.82 MB without them; the bodies were\n  4.58 MB of the larger file."
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/kg/kg-core/kg-export.md#provenance-61",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "What a slice file holds",
      "prov:value": "**What the payload is, is a per-slice decision**:\n  a bean's or a todo's source file verbatim; for the library, the PUBLISHED\n  `entries/<id>.json`, one payload per entry that every one of its blocks\n  points at, never the section files under `library/`, because a withheld\n  entry (bean `cw35`) publishes no verbatim text and the published entry is\n  what already applied that rule; for `kg`, the KG's own committed payloads,\n  from the same `planPayloads` call the subgraph files use.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "bean cw35"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/kg/kg-core/kg-export.md#provenance-62",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "Content-addressed file, fixed-name manifest",
      "prov:value": "**Bean `wixl`, 2026-10-03.** The database was published at `<slice>.sqlite3`,\none path across builds.",
