      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "The client — download, OPFS, mount, with a fallback",
      "prov:value": "Import it\n   into the pool and unlink older builds of that slice.\n4. Open it. `info.contentAddressed` is false only for a pre-`wixl` manifest\n   that names a fixed path."
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/kg/kg-core/kg-export.md#provenance-65",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "The client — download, OPFS, mount, with a fallback",
      "prov:value": "Measured in Chromium against a plain static server with no COOP/COEP: first\nopen, including download and verification, 110 to 190 ms per slice on\nloopback (table above); reopen from OPFS about 85 ms, with no download."
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/kg/kg-core/kg-export.md#provenance-66",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "The search page — one page, the slice is a parameter",
      "prov:value": "`beans/search.html`, the pilot's own page, is now a forwarding page to\n`?slice=beans`, so a link to it still lands."
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/kg/kg-core/kg-export.md#provenance-67",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "Adding a node type",
      "prov:value": "Never hand-build an IRI: `makeIri` is the one place every node's\n   IRI is decided, so the move from `#fragment` to `<doc\n   dir>/<kind>/<id>` (§\"Subject IRIs — a path, not a `#fragment`\") changes\n   them all at once.\n3."
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/kg/kg-core/kg-export.md#provenance-68",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "Adding a node type",
      "prov:value": "The\n   export reports `danglingLinks` for exactly this, and the four that remain\n   are data defects (bean `nup0`), not exporter bugs.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "bean nup0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/kg/kg-core/kg-export.md#provenance-69",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "Running it",
      "prov:value": "The output is a **build artifact**, deliberately not committed: it is a\nsnapshot of a tree that changes every commit, so a committed copy is stale by\nconstruction and invites the drift `5o3a` describes. CI regenerates it on every\npublish."
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/kg/kg-core/kg-export.md#provenance-70",
